00:02:48.970 --> 00:02:51.560
<b>Whoa, it's really gold!</b>

00:02:51.560 --> 00:02:53.020
<b>Wow!</b>

00:02:53.020 --> 00:02:58.740
<b>I didn't expect much from a field trip to Kyoto,
but it's surprisingly quite exciting, right, Mayu?</b>

00:03:00.360 --> 00:03:02.740
<b>Oh, yes. It sure is.</b>

00:03:02.980 --> 00:03:05.150
<b>So, next is Arashiyama?</b>

00:03:05.150 --> 00:03:07.450
<b>Oh my, I just can't wait!</b>

00:03:11.330 --> 00:03:14.580
<b>Men, this is a challenge for history!</b>

00:03:14.580 --> 00:03:17.760
<b>We're going to draw mystery circles here!</b>

00:03:19.250 --> 00:03:22.000
<b>It'd be a huge problem if you guys did that!</b>

00:03:24.100 --> 00:03:25.220
<b>What is it this time?</b>

00:03:29.810 --> 00:03:31.730
<b>Please look this way.</b>

00:03:32.050 --> 00:03:35.470
<b>As expected from Kyoto. We receive
the finishing blow the moment we arrive!</b>

00:03:35.470 --> 00:03:37.890
<b>Get their permission to take pictures first!</b>

00:03:37.890 --> 00:03:39.440
<b>There's a problem!</b>

00:03:40.270 --> 00:03:41.860
<b>One after another.</b>

00:03:44.410 --> 00:03:48.910
<b>An<i> Eating Research Club</i> member collapsed after eating too much yatsuhashi!</b>

00:03:49.410 --> 00:03:53.240
<b>I'm begging you all, please,
enjoy the field trip like normal people.</b>

00:03:53.240 --> 00:03:55.380
<b>Like normal...</b>

00:03:57.000 --> 00:03:59.880
<b>Sensei, please say something to them too.</b>

00:03:59.880 --> 00:04:02.470
<b>They're creating one problem after another.</b>

00:04:02.920 --> 00:04:06.170
<b>That's why you're here, right, Ninomiya?</b>

00:04:06.170 --> 00:04:08.220
<b>I'll be busy at night.</b>

00:04:09.130 --> 00:04:12.060
<b>I'll let you handle it since you're a committee member.</b>

00:04:13.980 --> 00:04:16.480
<b>All you're doing is sleeping.</b>

00:04:21.990 --> 00:04:24.240
<b>You look kinda tired.</b>

00:04:25.160 --> 00:04:26.940
<b>Okushiro-san!</b>

00:04:26.940 --> 00:04:29.320
<b>Would you like to take a break with me?</b>

00:04:29.320 --> 00:04:31.750
<b>I don't think that's a good idea.</b>

00:04:31.750 --> 00:04:34.530
<b>I know a lot of great shops here.</b>

00:04:34.530 --> 00:04:36.740
<b>Ugh, what should I do?</b>

00:04:36.740 --> 00:04:39.750
<b>I've still not managed to invite him out for the leisure time tomorrow.</b>

00:04:39.750 --> 00:04:42.040
<b>Don't worry about that, 'kay?</b>

00:04:42.040 --> 00:04:43.260
<b>Like I said!</b>

00:04:43.880 --> 00:04:45.500
<b>Ninomiya-kun!</b>

00:04:45.500 --> 00:04:47.630
<b>Hey, Tsukimura-san. Alone?</b>

00:04:50.310 --> 00:04:52.480
<b>Tasuku-san.</b>

00:04:52.480 --> 00:04:58.230
<b>Say, do you have any plans for tomorrow's leisure time? Would you like to spend it together?</b>

00:05:00.390 --> 00:05:01.480
<b>But...</b>

00:05:01.480 --> 00:05:06.070
<b>You don't have to be so modest. I was born in Kyoto, so I can show you the sights.</b>

00:05:06.950 --> 00:05:09.360
<b>It's not that. I...</b>

00:05:11.820 --> 00:05:13.410
<b>Tsukimura-san?</b>

00:05:13.740 --> 00:05:15.280
<b>That man...</b>

00:05:15.280 --> 00:05:20.000
<b>You're really bad, Ninomiya-san. 
You're ignoring me when I'm talking to you.</b>

00:05:20.000 --> 00:05:21.420
<b>No, that's because...</b>

00:05:23.210 --> 00:05:27.680
<b>Then, as punishment, will you accompany me to the Tougetsu Bridge?</b>

00:05:27.680 --> 00:05:30.960
<b>Well, I could do that much.</b>

00:05:30.960 --> 00:05:32.310
<b>Come on, let's get going.</b>

00:05:35.140 --> 00:05:37.720
<b>Hey, let go.</b>

00:05:40.400 --> 00:05:42.820
<b>That glasses wench!</b>

00:05:43.770 --> 00:05:45.600
<b>This sure is a coincidence, isn't it?</b>

00:05:45.600 --> 00:05:50.190
<b>After concluding the business in Kyoto and coming here
to observe the growth of Sagano's bamboo thicket</b>

00:05:50.190 --> 00:05:52.740
<b>who would have thought that we would run into our school's field trip?</b>

00:05:52.740 --> 00:05:54.660
<b>Is it really a coincidence?</b>

00:05:54.660 --> 00:05:56.450
<b>Let's just say that it is.</b>

00:05:56.450 --> 00:05:58.330
<b>Since this is something that Ojou-sama decided.</b>

00:05:58.330 --> 00:06:01.330
<b>Argh, that wench is so clingy!</b>

00:06:01.330 --> 00:06:03.210
<b>Let go, damnit!</b>

00:06:03.210 --> 00:06:06.050
<b>It looks like this year's night party is gonna be like the last one.</b>

00:06:07.080 --> 00:06:12.550
<b>Last year, we obliterated those worms who tried to swarm Ojou-sama.</b>

00:06:14.550 --> 00:06:19.890
<b>But, what if Ninomiya attempts to sneak into one of the girls' rooms?</b>

00:06:20.810 --> 00:06:23.230
<b>I already have something planned for that.</b>

00:06:24.480 --> 00:06:28.060
<b>Come. Next is surveying the water quality at the Katsure River.</b>

00:06:41.460 --> 00:06:45.210
<b>I guess this is the short respite after dinner.</b>

00:06:45.210 --> 00:06:48.130
<b>But the problem comes later.</b>

00:06:49.840 --> 00:06:51.670
<b>Ninomiya-kun?</b>

00:06:51.670 --> 00:06:55.130
<b>Tsukimura-san? Sorry. You all right?</b>

00:06:55.130 --> 00:06:58.180
<b>Yes. I...</b>

00:06:58.180 --> 00:07:01.140
<b>So, are you heading to the bath now?</b>

00:07:01.140 --> 00:07:03.890
<b>Yes, together with Hinako-san and the rest.</b>

00:07:03.890 --> 00:07:05.180
<b>I see.</b>

00:07:08.070 --> 00:07:13.740
<b><i>I must ask: "Would you like to spend
the leisure time tomorrow together?"</i></b>

00:07:14.330 --> 00:07:17.700
<b><i>I have to ask Tsukimura-san about that man...</i></b>

00:07:18.540 --> 00:07:19.820
<b>Um...</b>

00:07:20.920 --> 00:07:24.200
<b>You can go first then.</b>

00:07:24.200 --> 00:07:27.210
<b>No, you can go first, Ninomiya-kun.</b>

00:07:27.210 --> 00:07:29.130
<b>No, I insist, you first.</b>

00:07:29.130 --> 00:07:31.210
<b>No, no, you first.</b>

00:07:31.210 --> 00:07:33.550
<b>You first.</b>

00:07:33.550 --> 00:07:35.720
<b>In that case, we'll go first!</b>

00:07:40.890 --> 00:07:44.310
<b>Okay, Ninomiya, let's go to the bath together!</b>

00:07:48.030 --> 00:07:49.940
<b>Why does it turn out like this?</b>

00:08:07.040 --> 00:08:08.500
<b>Mayu!</b>

00:08:10.250 --> 00:08:12.840
<b>I can grab so much even with the towel.</b>

00:08:12.840 --> 00:08:14.880
<b>Your breasts are really huge.</b>

00:08:15.340 --> 00:08:18.640
<b>I'm gonna get angry, Hinako-san. Please let go.</b>

00:08:18.970 --> 00:08:22.470
<b>You're one to talk, you and your big breasts!</b>

00:08:22.470 --> 00:08:24.640
<b>Then, how's this?</b>

00:08:27.060 --> 00:08:31.850
<b>Here? Does this feel good? Come on, tell me.</b>

00:08:36.190 --> 00:08:38.450
<b>Ah, what a nice bath.</b>

00:08:48.450 --> 00:08:49.920
<b>What the hell is this?</b>

00:08:55.250 --> 00:08:57.920
<b>Let us combine our strength, Ninomiya.</b>

00:08:57.920 --> 00:09:00.920
<b>The girls' bath lies at the top of the cliff.</b>

00:09:00.920 --> 00:09:03.800
<b>That is what they were struggling to reach.</b>

00:09:09.520 --> 00:09:11.440
<b>This looks impossible.</b>

00:09:13.440 --> 00:09:15.110
<b>Okay, let's go?</b>

00:09:16.060 --> 00:09:18.440
<b>Where did you get those ropes from?</b>

00:09:19.240 --> 00:09:21.990
<b>You're amazed that we have tricks like this, right?</b>

00:09:21.990 --> 00:09:25.160
<b>We two are going to be the ones who conquer the girls' bath!</b>

00:09:27.420 --> 00:09:29.040
<b>I have to stop them.</b>

00:09:33.120 --> 00:09:36.220
<b>Wait up, you two!</b>

00:09:39.260 --> 00:09:41.380
<b>You're doing really well bare-handed.</b>

00:09:41.380 --> 00:09:43.430
<b>Well, let's all get along and reach the top then.</b>

00:09:43.430 --> 00:09:46.440
<b>I'm here to stop you guys.</b>

00:09:47.600 --> 00:09:49.720
<b>Hm, what's that sound?</b>

00:09:49.720 --> 00:09:50.940
<b>It's close!</b>

00:09:54.020 --> 00:09:55.190
<b>A radio controlled chopper?</b>

00:10:00.280 --> 00:10:01.280
<b>The rope...</b>

00:10:01.280 --> 00:10:02.200
<b>Damn it!</b>

00:10:12.460 --> 00:10:14.920
<b>Those who failed to reach Eden...</b>

00:10:14.920 --> 00:10:16.970
<b>please lend us your strength!</b>

00:10:23.170 --> 00:10:24.430
<b>That's bullshit.</b>

00:10:27.100 --> 00:10:30.690
<b>We have surpassed the limits of humans!</b>

00:10:30.690 --> 00:10:33.480
<b>So it was impossible after all?!</b>

00:10:33.770 --> 00:10:35.480
<b>Inoue! Yoshida!</b>

00:10:38.820 --> 00:10:41.570
<b>It's gonna be bad if I fall from here.</b>

00:10:44.490 --> 00:10:45.490
<b>That side looks workable.</b>

00:10:46.000 --> 00:10:48.950
<b>For now, doesn't seem like any way but up.</b>

00:10:56.790 --> 00:11:00.010
<b>Learn to just give up, because
it will be impossible every year.</b>

00:11:00.010 --> 00:11:02.550
<b>Exactly.</b>

00:11:02.550 --> 00:11:05.760
<b>Now, I can leisurely enjoy my bath.</b>

00:11:24.740 --> 00:11:28.790
<b>What a coincidence to meet here of all places.</b>

00:11:44.930 --> 00:11:47.920
<b>I thought I just heard someone's voice.</b>

00:11:47.920 --> 00:11:49.930
<b>You sure it wasn't your imagination?</b>

00:11:53.810 --> 00:11:55.940
<b>My, my.</b>

00:12:09.240 --> 00:12:10.320
<b>Come on, let's go.</b>

00:12:11.410 --> 00:12:13.580
<b>Hey, who are you?</b>

00:12:13.870 --> 00:12:16.450
<b>Nevermind that. Hurry.</b>

00:12:49.530 --> 00:12:53.370
<b>You're going to repay that debt from back then!</b>

00:12:57.120 --> 00:13:01.290
<b>Hey Mayu, do you know about our school's traditional event?</b>

00:13:01.290 --> 00:13:02.920
<b>Traditional event?</b>

00:13:03.170 --> 00:13:10.180
<b>I heard that during the first night of the field trip,
the boys would sneak into the girls' rooms.</b>

00:13:10.180 --> 00:13:12.880
<b>Sneak in?</b>

00:13:12.880 --> 00:13:16.300
<b>What would you do if Ninomiya-kun comes for you?</b>

00:13:16.300 --> 00:13:17.640
<b>Will you give yourself to him?</b>

00:13:17.640 --> 00:13:20.190
<b>Wh-what are you saying, Hinako-san?</b>

00:13:20.520 --> 00:13:24.940
<b>I'm just kidding. If only there were guys with enough guts to try.</b>

00:13:24.940 --> 00:13:27.530
<b>I was thinking about it a little.</b>

00:13:27.530 --> 00:13:29.990
<b>What daring words from Hinako.</b>

00:13:29.990 --> 00:13:32.320
<b>But since it's the field trip after all.</b>

00:13:32.320 --> 00:13:35.030
<b>Should we give them some freebies?</b>

00:13:37.540 --> 00:13:42.300
<b>I must use this chance tonight to talk to Ninomiya-kun about tomorrow.</b>

00:14:10.530 --> 00:14:14.030
<b>This is Hebishima. I've infiltrated the inn.</b>

00:14:14.030 --> 00:14:15.790
<b>I'm making my way towards the girls' room now.</b>

00:14:19.780 --> 00:14:21.540
<b>Hm, did I get stuck in something?</b>

00:14:25.370 --> 00:14:27.420
<b>Good work.</b>

00:14:28.880 --> 00:14:32.470
<b>Let me go. I'm ten years too young to...</b>

00:14:31.670 --> 00:14:33.430
<b>Shut up and march.</b>

00:14:47.940 --> 00:14:49.450
<b>There are only two remaining from Class D.</b>

00:14:49.450 --> 00:14:51.320
<b>We've lost nearly all of Class C.</b>

00:14:51.320 --> 00:14:54.450
<b>The last survivor is currently in a skirmish with a teacher on the third floor.</b>

00:14:54.820 --> 00:14:56.990
<b>There are patrols crossing infiltration route D.</b>

00:14:56.990 --> 00:14:59.460
<b>Routes E and F are already under their control.</b>

00:15:00.240 --> 00:15:03.200
<b>No, it can't be.</b>

00:15:03.200 --> 00:15:05.960
<b>Is there no one who can get past the surveillance?</b>

00:15:06.460 --> 00:15:08.470
<b>Information could have leaked out.</b>

00:15:08.720 --> 00:15:11.040
<b>Th-That couldn't have happened.</b>

00:15:12.670 --> 00:15:17.630
<b>I see. This is what you had planned.</b>

00:15:17.630 --> 00:15:19.480
<b>What are you saying, Hosaka?</b>

00:15:20.140 --> 00:15:24.310
<b>To prevent the students from having impure relationships,</b>

00:15:24.310 --> 00:15:28.770
<b>I got the teachers to help stand watch by offering them information.</b>

00:15:29.270 --> 00:15:31.490
<b>As expected from Ojou-sama. A sound plan.</b>

00:15:32.860 --> 00:15:36.990
<b>Even if what I did was wrong, I won't allow the night party to succeed.</b>

00:15:39.500 --> 00:15:41.570
<b>Hey, hang in there, everyone!</b>

00:15:41.570 --> 00:15:45.540
<b>If this goes on, then the night party tradition ends with our generation!</b>

00:15:46.160 --> 00:15:49.040
<b>I guess I can rest easy if it stays this way.</b>

00:15:49.040 --> 00:15:51.760
<b>Hey, Ninomiya, a call for you.</b>

00:15:52.130 --> 00:15:54.750
<b>The guy on the top row, second from the right.</b>

00:15:55.800 --> 00:15:56.970
<b>He's...</b>

00:15:56.970 --> 00:15:58.770
<b>This is Okushiro Tasuku from Class B.</b>

00:15:59.130 --> 00:16:01.980
<b>I'm going to sneak into Tsukimura Mayu's room now.</b>

00:16:02.350 --> 00:16:04.100
<b>Tsukimura-san's room?</b>

00:16:05.110 --> 00:16:07.440
<b>Watch me from there, Ninomiya Shungo!</b>

00:16:17.320 --> 00:16:18.990
<b>Who is that boy?</b>

00:16:18.990 --> 00:16:20.280
<b>That's ain't normal.</b>

00:16:21.330 --> 00:16:23.750
<b>If he continues like this, then he'll...</b>

00:16:24.330 --> 00:16:25.910
<b>Ninomiya...</b>

00:16:30.260 --> 00:16:32.920
<b>Very well, this is the final order.</b>

00:16:32.920 --> 00:16:35.260
<b>We're gonna go on a suicide mission now.</b>

00:16:38.210 --> 00:16:42.090
<b>We'll restore the command room later.
Now you are free to act as you wish.</b>

00:16:42.840 --> 00:16:43.770
<b>However...</b>

00:16:44.230 --> 00:16:46.770
<b>make tonight a night you'll never regret!</b>

00:16:50.140 --> 00:16:51.600
<b>Dismissed!</b>

00:16:57.230 --> 00:16:59.320
<b>Time to go, Ninomiya.</b>

00:16:59.320 --> 00:17:02.000
<b>We're going to close this with some huge fireworks!</b>

00:17:03.250 --> 00:17:04.410
<b>You guys...</b>

00:17:06.370 --> 00:17:08.290
<b>Take this with you, Ninomiya.</b>

00:17:08.290 --> 00:17:10.170
<b>This is a sketch of the inn's layout.</b>

00:17:19.260 --> 00:17:20.260
<b>Hold it.</b>

00:17:20.720 --> 00:17:24.430
<b>Kitchen staff don't work at this hour.</b>

00:17:24.430 --> 00:17:27.350
<b>Show me what's inside!</b>

00:17:30.270 --> 00:17:31.530
<b>Hello.</b>

00:17:31.530 --> 00:17:33.030
<b>Inoue, make a run for it!</b>

00:17:33.030 --> 00:17:33.490
<b>Yuppie!</b>

00:17:34.900 --> 00:17:37.070
<b>Hold it, you two!</b>

00:17:37.070 --> 00:17:39.120
<b>Sorry, Nakamura-sensei!</b>

00:17:39.120 --> 00:17:41.360
<b>Please overlook this!</b>

00:17:46.160 --> 00:17:48.200
<b>Forgive me, you two.</b>

00:18:03.510 --> 00:18:05.550
<b>I should be nearing it soon.</b>

00:18:06.060 --> 00:18:08.560
Take your fighting spirit with you !        Yoshi

00:18:06.060 --> 00:18:08.560
We'll leave the rest to you.       Ino

00:18:09.100 --> 00:18:10.640
<b>Those guys.</b>

00:18:22.940 --> 00:18:25.910
<b>I wonder how Ninomiya is doing.</b>

00:18:25.910 --> 00:18:28.290
<b>It's him after all. It'll turn out well.</b>

00:18:28.790 --> 00:18:34.050
<b>Now, if only he'd become a more interesting person after this.</b>

00:18:38.670 --> 00:18:40.050
<b>Right on.</b>

00:18:42.130 --> 00:18:43.840
<b>If I go up here...</b>

00:18:43.840 --> 00:18:46.060
<b>You're finally showing some enthusiasm, Ninomiya.</b>

00:18:47.310 --> 00:18:49.060
<b>Okushiro Tasuku!</b>

00:18:50.100 --> 00:18:52.180
<b>Don't make such a scary face.</b>

00:18:52.180 --> 00:18:55.070
<b>I'm going to give you a taste of heaven right now.</b>

00:18:55.440 --> 00:18:56.560
<b>What?</b>

00:19:02.690 --> 00:19:04.240
<b>What's going on?</b>

00:19:05.860 --> 00:19:08.360
<b>You can do something as simple as that too can't you?</b>

00:19:08.360 --> 00:19:10.080
<b>What are you saying?</b>

00:19:10.580 --> 00:19:13.910
<b>Hmph, so you've forgotten those things unfavourable to you?</b>

00:19:13.910 --> 00:19:16.590
<b>I've not forgotten even though you have.</b>

00:19:17.080 --> 00:19:20.590
<b>What have I forgotten?</b>

00:19:20.590 --> 00:19:21.920
<b>Well, whatever.</b>

00:19:21.920 --> 00:19:26.310
<b>I'm going to take Tsukimura Mayu, and show you the same pain you've caused to me.</b>

00:19:30.810 --> 00:19:31.930
<b>A blackout?</b>

00:19:31.930 --> 00:19:34.140
<b>Whatever, the boys aren't going to come anyways.</b>

00:19:34.140 --> 00:19:35.930
<b>Gah, let's just go to bed then.</b>

00:19:35.930 --> 00:19:37.310
<b>Let's do that then.</b>

00:19:44.990 --> 00:19:46.120
<b>Okay.</b>

00:19:47.160 --> 00:19:49.070
<b>Enough of this. Now!</b>

00:19:52.040 --> 00:19:52.960
<b>Wait!</b>

00:19:59.760 --> 00:20:02.680
<b>Damnit! Where did he go?</b>

00:20:11.800 --> 00:20:16.270
<b>Sheesh. What's with this sudden power outage?</b>

00:20:16.270 --> 00:20:18.860
<b>I'm sure the breaker is on the lower floor.</b>

00:20:21.690 --> 00:20:26.870
<b>This darkness is scary, but I must invite Ninomiya-kun.</b>

00:20:35.880 --> 00:20:39.380
<b><i>What's going on?</i></b>

00:20:39.380 --> 00:20:42.750
<b><i>My strength is being sapped from my body...</i></b>

00:20:44.460 --> 00:20:48.390
<b><i>I remember this feeling from before...</i></b>

00:21:25.430 --> 00:21:27.380
<b>Thanks for the meal.</b>

00:21:49.700 --> 00:21:51.240
<b>Ninomiya Shungo?</b>

00:21:51.620 --> 00:21:54.120
<b>What's wrong? Snap out of it.</b>

00:21:54.120 --> 00:21:55.660
